WEBVTT

00:02:27.768 --> 00:02:32.690
and I was on an upward trajectory
when I decided to walk away from it all.

00:02:34.442 --> 00:02:35.818
Why?

00:02:35.818 --> 00:02:37.028
I was stressed.

00:02:38.279 --> 00:02:40.114
I was chronically ill,

00:02:40.114 --> 00:02:42.783
and I was questioning
my larger purpose in the world.

00:02:43.284 --> 00:02:45.077
I knew I wanted to leave,

00:02:45.119 --> 00:02:48.372
but I felt responsible to the women
of color coming up after me.

00:02:48.873 --> 00:02:50.249
I met Rha,

00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:52.460
she changed my life,

00:02:52.501 --> 00:02:54.420
and she became my coach.

00:02:54.462 --> 00:02:56.923
And together we started
gathering women of color.

00:02:58.132 --> 00:03:00.801
To figure out if I should stay
or if I should go.